# This deployment is the static crosswalk UI only.
#
# Vercel auto-detects an `api/` directory as Python serverless functions and
# pulls in boto3, anthropic and psycopg, which blows past the 500 MB function
# limit. None of it is needed: the published site reads a snapshot exported
# from Postgres at build time (web/public/graph-snapshot.json).
#
# To host the live API instead, deploy it separately and set VITE_API_BASE.

api/
collector/
apps/
graph/
infra/
db/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
*.md
!web/**
Makefile
.env.example
